1. Code & Collaborate:
   git switch -c feature/branch ──► Commit ──► Push ──► Open Pull Request

2. Continuous Integration (CI):
   GitHub Runner spawns ──► Checkout ──► Install Deps ──► Run Automated Tests

3. Containerization:
   Build Docker Image (Layer Caching) ──► Push to Container Registry (ghcr.io / Docker Hub)

4. Continuous Delivery / Deployment (CD):
   Deploy to Staging ──► Manual Gate Approval ──► Rolling / Blue-Green Deploy to Production



